  "system": {
    "identifier": "akimichi-caloric-recharge",
    "description": "<p>By spending any number of calories, you are able to regain hit points by forcibly converting them into healing energies.</p>\n<p>For every Calorie spent this way, you regain 1d8+1 hit point, up to a maximum of 10 calories spent.</p>\n<p>Expansion Crash. You can impart this healing onto a willing creature you can reach. If you do, this casting time becomes 1 Action.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above B-Rank, increase the amount of hit points regained for each calorie spent by +2.</p>",
